{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-19T16:25:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056773286487634356"],"id":"2056773286487634356","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":20896,"like_count":124,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":12},"text":"520的话，不是只对恋人吧！希望我以后也可以继续有丰沛的爱，去享受和维护每一段关系，去爱很多很多人和事，总之希望以后也可以继续爱下去…爱什么都可以……","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056773286487634356"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-19T16:18:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056771601509884147"],"id":"2056771601509884147","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1413,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"520到了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056771601509884147"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-19T10:22:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056681888090407211"],"id":"2056681888090407211","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18739,"like_count":39,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":58,"retweet_count":1},"text":"朋友跟我打视频，突然撩起他的刘海露出一片圆形红印子，问我你知道这个是怎么造成的吗，之后他向我展示了一只独角兽的诞生…（意指假根吸盘太猛他拔不下来给吸了一个圆形草莓在额头。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056681888090407211"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-19T07:17:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056635386143920458"],"id":"2056635386143920458","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":15954,"like_count":166,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":47,"retweet_count":23},"text":"能长久的陪伴在身边原来是这样一件难得的事，时间太残忍了，我渐渐不记得那张朝思暮念的脸，不记得那些过往，不记得那些相伴的日子，比衰老可怕的是：我不再期盼重逢，我也终于将你留在的那个回不去的天地，你比时间残忍","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056635386143920458"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-19T07:15:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056634929749152089"],"id":"2056634929749152089","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2623,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":6},"text":"一些事情给我们带来的痛苦，比它们实际上本该带来的更多；另一些事情在它们该来之前，就已经开始折磨我们；还有一些事情则在本来根本不该折磨我们的时候折磨我们。我们习惯夸大痛苦，幻想痛苦，预计痛苦。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056634929749152089"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-19T07:09:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056633293865619751"],"id":"2056633293865619751","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4969,"like_count":81,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":18},"text":"任何人不要再丢下我了好吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056633293865619751"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-18T18:02:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056435335924695413"],"id":"2056435335924695413","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5476,"like_count":98,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":8},"text":"https://t.co/iqY6vchHVx","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056435335924695413"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-18T17:00:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056419733461966953"],"id":"2056419733461966953","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3237,"like_count":68,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":13},"text":"我什么也做不了，只能靠着小笨枕头默默的流几滴眼泪","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056419733461966953"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-18T16:54:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056418211839787161"],"id":"2056418211839787161","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2999,"like_count":44,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":5},"text":"感情一坨稀泥，爱好没有坚持，一聊天未来工作也一片渺茫，我以为两眼一黑是睡着了，其实是死了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056418211839787161"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-18T16:53:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056417924286714329"],"id":"2056417924286714329","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":12144,"like_count":285,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":41,"retweet_count":38},"text":"那天之后 我就没有再打扰过你了 晚上还是会控制不住 但是我对自己说没关系的 睡着了就不会想你了 这道坎我真的过不去了可是你说的那些话我真的听进去了 我没有勇气再去打扰你了 我们之间存在好多误会和问题 我们本不因该这样","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056417924286714329"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-18T12:18:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056348647139450908"],"id":"2056348647139450908","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":32099,"like_count":432,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":72,"retweet_count":84},"text":"我们还能以这样稀薄的羁绊联系多少日夜","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056348647139450908"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-18T09:09:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056301245187670030"],"id":"2056301245187670030","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3104,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"偶尔心血来潮打开私信想看看有没有新消息发现全都是丑鸡巴和广告🐔","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056301245187670030"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-17T23:04:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056148935362896105"],"id":"2056148935362896105","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2543,"like_count":30,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我睡不着，我好焦虑，我好怀念娘胎里那十个月无压力无社交的日子","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056148935362896105"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:05:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056043450882245066"],"id":"2056043450882245066","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5300,"like_count":64,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":8},"text":"别让我在这样一个人哭干眼泪孤独一个人","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056043450882245066"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:01:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2056042386397278646"],"id":"2056042386397278646","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":4687,"like_count":133,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":21},"text":"请你再给我一点时间 我太迟钝了 每当我意识到这就是幸福的时候 幸福已经流失我的手心了 像连绵不断的水 抓不住 也不剩一点点给我","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2056042386397278646"},{"author_id":"191704